# MICAPP Development Rules

- ALWAYS run `./start.sh --build` or `./start.sh` after making any code changes to ensure the application builds correctly and changes are applied.
- Prefer using absolute paths when calling tools.
- Follow the existing project structure:
  - `code/`: Go source files.
  - `recordings/`: Audio recording storage.
- Ensure `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set in the environment before running.

